{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポ最後でーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田花奈 presents 乃木坂「踊ってみた」選手権"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回にわけてこの企画やらせてもらったけど\n本当にたくさんの応募ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンのみなさんと作れる企画ができて\n良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんご軍団の何度目の軍団か？\nチームセムガエの遥かなるブータン\nとかメンバーも投稿してくれたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４６時間振り返り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エンディング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『きっかけ』の黒板アート\nなんか泣けました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャボン玉のとこしかできなかったんだけど\n黒板アートってすごいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動的でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レポ5つになっちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナカダリズム\nかなりいい時間帯にやらせてもらえたのに\nトレンド入りしたそうで！\n凄く嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トレンド入りと言えば\n女子校ユニット名も募集してたんだけど\n決める時間がなかったから\n送ってくださった中から\nどこかで決める機会があったらいいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"46時間長いようで\nあっという間だった気がする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださったみなさん\n何時間くらい見てくれたのかな～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホいじってるカズミンと\n鏡チェック中のカナミン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリラジの藤森さん\nWエンジンさん\nハリー杉山さん\nラフレクランさん\n武井壮さん\n乃木坂芸人の早出さん\n高橋大輔アナウンサー\nクイズ王の古川さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルピーさん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駆けつけてくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも\n乃木坂46をよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん方、お疲れ様でした！！\n本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん寝てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/06/13/1225279/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でした"},{"type":"image"